* If the target becomes {{tip|untargetable}}, {{tip|death|dies}}, or is no longer in {{tip|sight}} during the cast time, this ability will cancel but does not go on {{sti|cooldown}} nor pay its cost.
** If they move too far away during the cast time, however, the ability will cancel as normal but still go on cooldown and pay its cost.{{bug}}
